# Built benchmark artifacts. Regenerated in full by run_benchmarks.sh.
build/

# The root .gitignore carries a blanket `*.c` (.gitignore:30) with negations for
# examples/, src/, tests/ and runtime/ -- but not for benchmarks/c/. That blanket
# is the same defect that kept runtime/palladium_runtime.c out of every commit
# (bootstrap-subset.md D1), and it is why benchmarks/c/ used to hold committed
# binaries with no committed sources. Re-include the C benchmark sources here so
# the suite is reproducible from a fresh clone.
!c/*.c
